# Environment
.env
.env.local

# Local npm config — for forkers behind a private corporate registry
# mirror (Artifactory, Nexus, JFrog, or any enterprise proxy). The
# README's "Behind a custom npm registry" note explains the
# workaround. Per-machine registry URLs and auth tokens never go
# upstream.
.npmrc

# Code-signing / notarization secrets — never commit
# Belt-and-suspenders: these files should live outside the repo entirely
# (~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/*.p8 for the API key, Keychain for certs).
# These globs catch accidental drops into the working tree.
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
build/notarize-api-key.json

# Coverage
coverage/

# Stage 6: icon and entitlements files are generated before distribution
# build/icon.icns
# build/entitlements.mac.plist

# cli/duo is intentionally tracked — pre-built binary so Geoff can install
# without a build step. Regenerate with: npm run build:cli

# Claude Code workspace state — ignore per-user settings + worktrees,
# but track the shared `launch.json` (preview server config for the
# roadmap HTML), the project-scoped `skills/` directory (each skill is
# a deliverable that any Claude session in this directory should
# auto-discover — e.g. `cut-version`), and the `rules/` directory
# (path-scoped instruction files that extend CLAUDE.md).
.claude/*
!.claude/launch.json
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/rules/**
fork.config.json
fork.config.local.json

# Smoke-walk pages and manifests — generated from sprint output.
# The skill at .claude/skills/smoke-walk/ produces these on demand;
# they're transient artifacts, not source. Keep the directory
# hierarchy out of git unless someone explicitly wants to commit a
# manifest as a release receipt (rare).
docs/dev/smoke-walks/*
docs/dev/worksheets/*

# Owner's idle-thoughts scratchpad — personal working file the
# `agent` reads + processes per the convention at the top of the
# file. Not a commit-worthy artifact (gets emptied as items move
# to Processed and eventually pruned).
idle-thoughts.md

# Storybook static build output (ENH-239)
storybook-static/
